"consent.body" = "To generate a proposal, NutriOptimize will send the patient's clinical profile (age, sex, measurements, allergies, medical conditions, and your notes) to the optimization engine via OpenRouter, which processes it with Google Gemini. The patient's full name is not sent; an initials-based reference is used instead.\n\nThis information leaves your device and is processed on third-party servers. Make sure you have the patient's consent under applicable data-protection law before continuing. You can revoke this authorization in Settings.";
